  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Diagnose the Error\r\n\r\n\r\nPlan for possible failures on your video streaming platform. \r\n\r\nChoose **two questions** that will lead to **four different error messages**. Fill in the flowchart and test cases table based on your plan.\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Define the **inputs** (states or controls) that drive each **decision** (diamond).\r\n\r\n2. Fill in all **three decision points** with a question and all **four outcomes**, where each outcome states the **exact error message**.\r\n\r\n3. Fill in the **Test Cases table** with one row for each path, showing how the different inputs lead to each outcome.\r\n\r\n4. Save your **flowchart to your Backpack** and add it to your files in the next level.\r\n",
    "display_name": "Error Message",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Diagnose the issue and display unique error messages.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/c55df447ff3af4618be4ef9af78bac03-Screenshot 2026-04-08 at 11.13.20 AM.png",
